WEBVTT

00:00:00.664 --> 00:00:03.103
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Hannah met Jamie last summer.

00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:07.848
It was Hannah’s birthday and she and her friends went to a club.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:17.164
They wanted to dance, but they didn’t like the music, so Hannah went to speak to the DJ.

00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:22.378
‘This music is awful,’ she said.

00:00:22.924 --> 00:00:24.931
‘Could you play something else?’

00:00:25.446 --> 00:00:31.809
The DJ looked at her and said, ‘Don’t worry, I have the perfect song for you.’

00:00:32.739 --> 00:00:37.612
Two minutes later, he said, ‘The next song is by Pink.

00:00:37.987 --> 00:00:41.443
It’s called ‘Get the Party Started’

00:00:41.887 --> 00:00:46.145
and it’s for a beautiful girl over there who’s wearing a pink dress.’

00:00:49.106 --> 00:00:51.538
Hannah knew that the song was for her.

00:00:55.114 --> 00:01:00.541
When Hannah and her friends left the club, the DJ was waiting for her at the door.

00:01:01.224 --> 00:01:04.919
‘Hi, I’m Jamie,’ he said to Hannah.

00:01:05.571 --> 00:01:07.009
‘Can I see you again?’

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.345
So Hannah gave him her phone number.

00:01:13.511 --> 00:01:17.914
The next day, Jamie phoned Hannah and invited her to dinner.

00:01:18.938 --> 00:01:24.220
He took her to a very romantic French restaurant and they talked all evening.

00:01:33.342 --> 00:01:37.055
Although the food wasn’t very good, they had a wonderful time.

00:01:39.264 --> 00:01:43.489
After that, Jamie and Hannah saw each other every day.

00:01:44.171 --> 00:01:50.674
Every evening, when Hannah finished work, they met at 5.30 in a coffee bar in the high street.

00:01:51.517 --> 00:01:53.014
They were madly in love.

00:01:54.123 --> 00:01:57.416
One evening in October, Hannah was at work.

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:02.298
As usual, she was going to meet Jamie at 5.30.

00:02:03.057 --> 00:02:05.062
It was dark and it was raining.

00:02:05.742 --> 00:02:06.997
She looked at her watch.

00:02:07.354 --> 00:02:10.589
It was 5.20! She was going to be late!

00:02:11.224 --> 00:02:13.536
She ran to her car and got in.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.513
At 5.25 she was driving along the high street.

00:02:22.051 --> 00:02:25.456
She was going very fast because she was in a hurry.

00:02:26.848 --> 00:02:29.577
Suddenly, a man ran across the road.

00:02:30.115 --> 00:02:34.203
He was wearing a dark coat, so Hannah didn’t see him at first.

00:02:35.126 --> 00:02:37.495
Quickly, she put her foot on the brake…